title: Day3_Scarlett
---

<<declare $name = "">>
<<declare $current_location = "">>


//Setting up the scene
<<ChangeLocation DialogueSignals "Hallway">>

<<SetCharacterLocation DialogueSignals "Scarlett" "Hallway">>

===
title: Convo
---
Scarlett: {$name}! {$name}!
{$name}: Scarlett? 
Scarlet: {$name}!!!!!
{$name}: Chill! I heard you the first time! What's going on, why are you freaking out?!
Scarlett: It's [BOSS]! He wants to see you!
{$name}: WHAT?! Like the boss? The big boss?
Scarlett: Like the big boss, king of the company, he who sees all. Him
{$name}: What for? What did I do? Am in trouble?
Scarlett: Hey I'm just the messenger, I got no clue. But he doesn't request meetings for just anything.
{$name}: Oh no. Am I getting fired?
Scarlett: ...maybe a promotion?
{$name}: ...be for real. No way I've got an impromptu meeting with [BOSS] for a measly security promotion.
{$name}: I'm so dead. So so dead.
Scarlett: Maybe... maybe it's about Cherry?
{$name}: What? What do you mean?
Scarlett: Well, you're the only one she's really spoken to. Maybe he wants to know what she said?
{$name}: Or maybe he wants to crucify me for talking to her.
Scarlett: Well, he's on his way here now. Uh, try not to freak out too much?
{$name}: Glowing advice, thanks. I'll see you at lunch?
Scarlett: If you live that long... 
Scarlett: Kidding!
Scarlett: Mostly.



===